## Import

Import a formula by name:

```shell
terraform import host_package_brew.neovim neovim
```

Use `<package_type>:<name>` for an explicit type, including casks and tapped
formulae:

```shell
terraform import host_package_brew.google_chrome cask:google-chrome
terraform import host_package_brew.terraform formula:hashicorp/tap/terraform
```

